


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_546fe028:


    "同一时间，满月照亮了教室里的阳菜和伦。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_7b832865:


    "如圣夜子所说，今晚的月光十分充足，不用照明也可以找东西。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_100d04d1:



    voice "2RI_1053"
    rin "「找到了～」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_3d45432f:


    "不一会儿，伦就找到了忘记的东西，在储物柜附近朝阳菜喊道。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_d01904f8:


    "和文猜的一样，她忘记的东西正是项圈。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_97861fa7:


    "伦在超市里注意到忘了东西，而阳菜没有听漏伦“啊”的声音，强行把她拉回了教室寻找。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_3d20d13b:



    voice "2HI_1042"
    hina "「太好了……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_1dece9a4:


    "阳菜看到项圈，松了口气。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_2da1572f:



    voice "2RI_1054"
    rin "「用不着这么担心吧。我知道它在哪的」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_17288932:


    "伦用手指转动着项圈。她对阳菜的过激反应感到些许意外。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_0a444ebc:



    voice "2HI_1043"
    hina "「……不是这么回事」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_cc1c67d7:


    "阳菜在黑暗中咬紧下唇。不知伦是否看到了这一幕。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_4b285ad7:



    voice "2RI_1055"
    rin "「明天再找不是也可以嘛？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_8ecd2dca:



    voice "2HI_1044"
    hina "「不可以！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_464b20f5:



    voice "2RI_1056"
    rin "「呜哇！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_3ddbd507:


    "阳菜对伦（自认为）的无心一言做出了激烈的反应，吓得伦一个激灵。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_cc4a9671:



    voice "2HI_1045"
    hina "「伦太不珍惜项圈了！我一直在说吧？说要好好保管它」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_aa9834fa:



    voice "2RI_1057"
    rin "「所以说这不是项圈，是choker……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_593408a4:



    voice "2HI_1046"
    hina "「称呼不重要！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_e9b62aa8:


    "伦不合时宜的吐槽被即刻驳回。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_9639cb4e:



    voice "2HI_1047"
    hina "「我可是把项圈当做伦的一部分因此十分重视的。伦也把它当做我好好珍惜啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_58b735ff:



    voice "2RI_1058"
    rin "「太夸张了吧。人和东西是不同的……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_c3f20659:


    "这是之前就有的，因阳菜与伦对“东西”的看法不同而产生的问题。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_1527a9bb:


    "对伦来说，“东西”不过是“东西”。但对阳菜来说，“东西”是“心意”的具象化。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_8f622d07:



    voice "2HI_1048"
    hina "「……正月的时候也把项圈忘在了家里」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_3e86a81f:



    voice "2RI_1059"
    rin "「那是无心之过啊。不在自己家所以很紧张……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_c8533ef9:



    voice "2HI_1049"
    hina "「……不只是项圈」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_9f42f4aa:


    "阳菜神色寂寞地低下头，但很快又抬起头来。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_9aea757f:



    voice "2HI_1050"
    hina "「新年参拜回来的时候，你甩开了我的手」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_627e8dec:



    voice "2RI_1060"
    rin "「那是因为突然看到班上同学迎面走过来感到羞耻所以就……话说，这件事不是已经解决了吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_90bdabaf:


    "——在伦心中是解决了。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_70f582a7:



    voice "2HI_1051"
    hina "「和我交往这件事，被大家知道的话会感到羞耻？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_d436745a:



    voice "2RI_1061"
    rin "「哈，你在说什么啊？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_0a2a6fef:


    "这是阳菜以前也问过的问题。阳菜很崇拜伦，所以她总会不安，担心自己配不上伦。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_b53ed085:


    "但伦并不明白阳菜为何不安、为何重复同样的问题。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_1deeee09:


    "日积月累的沮丧之情，在阳菜的心湖里激起不安的波浪。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_0efb0853:


    "总是会在这时介入仲裁的文和圣夜子如今并不在场。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_ce939e01:



    voice "2HI_1052"
    hina "「和本条同学就不会感到羞耻了吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_bc8d5d3b:



    voice "2RI_1062"
    rin "「你又在说这种事了！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_cf1343d0:


    "伦有些粗暴地关上储物柜后，朝教室前方的门走去。阳菜小跑着尾随其后。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_3df55ca7:



    voice "2RI_1063"
    rin "「我要生气了啊？这件事和祥子姐那时候一样都是误会吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_5778bca4:


    "不对哦伦。阳菜不是在怀疑你花心，而是希望你严肃对待。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_fad77760:



    voice "2HI_1053"
    hina "「为什么不好好拒绝？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_e7ac47c5:


    "阳菜堵住了出口。伦只好放弃离开教室的想法，倚靠在讲台上。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_3f128413:



    voice "2RI_1064"
    rin "「因为想不到合适的拒绝方法啊。我并不想被别人讨厌啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_2c1a152f:


    "哪怕这样做会让真正重要的人讨厌你？"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_4e16fe56:



    voice "2HI_1054"
    hina "「我明明只看着伦，但伦总是看向别处，不看向我」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_43d56d31:



    voice "2RI_1065"
    rin "「诶，有吗……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_b2113532:



    voice "2HI_1055"
    hina "「好好看着我啊！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_f7ff8cb5:



    voice "2RI_1066"
    rin "「……哈哈」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_08dc40af:


    "阳菜追问之下，伦再次错开了视线。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_811b2bee:


    "在！这！最！糟！糕！的！时！候！"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_d484443f:



    voice "2HI_1056"
    hina "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_abae0510:


    "无声的火花炸开了。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_c312d564:



    voice "2RI_1067"
    rin "「呜哇！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_b3d40fba:


    "伦被推倒在黑板下方。项圈从她手中落下，掉在了地上。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_491136a8:



    voice "2RI_1068"
    rin "「等等，阳菜？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_9ec9987f:



    voice "2HI_1057"
    hina "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_cdeed810:


    "阳菜俯视着伦。她倒竖的卷发被月光镀上了一层银边，看上去像是鬃毛一般。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_e56f2dfe:



    voice "2RI_1069"
    rin "「啊，choker，得捡起来……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_62d383b8:


    "伦扭动着身体想要逃跑，但阳菜丝毫没有减缓压制的力气。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_d9a31751:



    voice "2RI_1070"
    rin "「你生气了？我道歉。我不会再忘记了。要是不小心忘记了阳菜你就提醒我——」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_98d94def:



    voice "2HI_1058"
    hina "「你不懂」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_b469dff1:



    voice "2RI_1071"
    rin "「呐，总之先站起来吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_3ef0e1e5:


    "伦再次想要起身——"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_9ecdde73:


    "砰。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_7ef7600c:


    "伦的额头被撞了回来。虽然撞击感不强，但她的身体却被更用力地压倒在地。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_5a37c8c4:



    voice "2HI_1059"
    hina "「……我要做」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_bcc073d6:



    voice "2RI_1072"
    rin "「诶？做什么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_d7ce0d6e:


    "阳菜没有回答。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_01bea2f7:



    voice "2RI_1073"
    rin "「诶、难道说？在这做？为什么会这样啊！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_14449156:


    "对事情发展方向有了头绪后伦开始动摇。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_a4dfc89d:



    voice "2RI_1074"
    rin "「我也不是对制服&教室这种王道场景不感兴趣，但也要给个心理准备对吧？下次再做吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_e405456d:


    "伦试图用平常的憨笑蒙混过关得以脱身。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_fec14b9a:


    "但这招对现在的阳菜并不管用。她滚烫的视线直逼向伦。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_c8c28999:



    voice "2RI_1075"
    rin "「呃，你这眼神，是认真的吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_ce70e30b:



    voice "2HI_1060"
    hina "「我一直很介意你说我“重”」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_cdd2340c:



    voice "2RI_1076"
    rin "「诶，减肥的事情吗？阳菜完全不胖——」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_b524b70e:



    voice "2HI_1061"
    hina "「不是。不是说体重。之前谈论项圈的时候，伦留下这么一句就离开了房间」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_f025ffaf:



    voice "2RI_1077"
    rin "「有这么回事吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_7d9ac1dd:



    voice "2HI_1062"
    hina "「有。我不想给伦添麻烦，所以一直忍着不去缠你」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_2fda529e:



    voice "2RI_1078"
    rin "「这种事你不用在意——」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_c3d78ed3:



    voice "2HI_1063"
    hina "「但是做不到啊！！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_2d06668a:


    "阳菜尖锐的声音震动了整个教室的空气，几乎把伦的身体缝到了墙上。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_254485a8:



    voice "2HI_1064"
    hina "「我要做。因为只有做的时候，你才会只看我一个人」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_ad2e6946:


    "咫尺之遥的滚烫吐息。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_d2e9f3ce:



    voice "2RI_1079"
    rin "「呃你看，这里是教室啊？保安随时可能过来，制服也会弄脏啊？所以，还是别做了吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_19f445cb:



    voice "2HI_1065"
    hina "「我不听」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_16f8b237:


    "那种轻浮的理论，阻挡不了此刻情绪高昂的猛兽。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_62ec28a2:


    "阳菜的瞳孔，在月光下发出更加耀眼的光芒。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_ee88418d:



    voice "2RI_1080"
    rin "「停下、停下……这事还是先保留吧，阳菜？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_806324a9:



    voice "2HI_1066"
    hina "「没戴项圈，不听」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_e02d3fa5:



    voice "2RI_1081"
    rin "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_dd33f458:


    "伦的心里咯噔一下。项圈掉在了数米开外。伸手也够不到。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_8683ac6a:



    voice "2RI_1082"
    rin "「咿？！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_faef0f73:


    "阳菜企图扯开伦的领口，就像是为了拉回伦错开的视线一般。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_214d7ae9:



    voice "2HI_1067"
    hina "「这都、怪伦……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_4742ca67:



    voice "2RI_1083"
    rin "「等、有点可怕啊……阳菜」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_daddda92:


    "已经不是闹着玩了。伦是真的在害怕。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_80e619b8:



    voice "2RI_1084"
    rin "「这已经不是狗了……是狼啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_c58e0c16:


    "伦颤抖着，眼神宛如羔羊。"




translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_08_cce19022:


    "伦在超市里注意到忘了东西，而阳菜没有听漏伦“啊”的声音，强行把她拉回了教室寻找。"
